#: .\admin.py:448
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Retained %(n)d key(s): %(reasons)s. Nothing changed — they stay scheduled, "
"so resolving the cause and deleting again works. Set "
"KEY_DELETION_CAN_RENDER_DATA_INACCESSIBLE to True in ENCRYPTION to delete "
"them regardless, making that data permanently unreadable."
msgstr ""
"Conservate %(n)d chiave/i: %(reasons)s. Nulla è cambiato — restano "
"pianificate, quindi risolvere la causa ed eliminare di nuovo funziona. "
"Imposta KEY_DELETION_CAN_RENDER_DATA_INACCESSIBLE su True in ENCRYPTION per "
"eliminarle comunque, rendendo quei dati permanentemente illeggibili."

#: .\admin.py:464
